# Each capture of interactive.spec.ts beside its frame of the approved
# prototype .superpowers/sdd/planner/prototype-board.html: <frame id>.png is
# that file rendered at the capture's 1280px viewport, dark, in the same
# state -- the running card, the waiting card, the running card hovered,
# then focused from the keyboard, and the run view its click opens -- into
# .superpowers/sdd/interactive-frames/.
interactive-running-card.png prototype-running-card
interactive-waiting-card.png prototype-waiting-card
interactive-running-card-hover.png prototype-running-card-hover
interactive-running-card-focus.png prototype-running-card-focus
interactive-run-view.png prototype-run-view
